config POSIX_REGEXP
	bool "POSIX regular expressions"
	help
	  Select 'y' here to enable the POSIX_REGEXP Option Group: regcomp(),
	  regerror(), regexec(), and regfree(), implemented with Henry
	  Spencer's regex engine (the same engine Newlib and Picolibc ship).

	  For more information, please see
	  https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/xrat/V4_subprofiles.html
